[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> function pickWinningCorrections(corrections) {
[?2004l[?2004h>   // Winner per (transaction_id, field): lexicographically greatest effective date.
[?2004l[?2004h>   // If effective ties, pick lexicographically greatest notice_id for determinism.
